## Motor (Python)

```python
from motor.motor_asyncio import AsyncIOMotorClient
from pydantic import BaseModel, EmailStr

class UserModel(BaseModel):
    email: EmailStr
    name: str

client = AsyncIOMotorClient(DATABASE_URL)
db = client.myapp
users_collection = db.users
```

